%% Selected move preview then terminal commit sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor User as User pointer
  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant Tools as CanvasToolPort
  participant IE as InteractionEngine
  participant ReadPort as InteractionReadPort
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant SelectionFacts as SelectionFactsPort
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant Preview as CanvasPreviewState
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant PlanCache as PaintPlanCache
  participant Resolver as CanvasMoveCommitResolver
  participant EK as EditKernel
  participant Draft as DraftDocument
  participant Touched as TouchedSet
  participant CC as CommitCompiler
  participant Effects as CommitEffects
  participant Applier as CommitApplier
  participant Projection as DocumentProjectionCache
  participant Events as EventBuffer
  participant Signals as Public signals

  User->>Surface: pointer down
  Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample down)
  Tools->>IE: normalized finite down sample
  IE->>IE: admit one active pointer token
  IE->>ReadPort: read selected move start facts
  ReadPort->>SelectionFacts: read selected ids and selectionRevision
  SelectionFacts-->>ReadPort: selected ids
  ReadPort->>Store: read transformable flags and document order
  Store-->>ReadPort: movable flags in document order
  ReadPort-->>IE: selected ids and movable flags in document order
  IE->>Spatial: hit-test down position once
  Spatial-->>IE: top visible selectable element id

  alt hit is selected and movable set is not empty
    IE->>IE: start selected move session
    Note over IE: Session stores pointer token, sessionId, start position, selected ids, movable ids, and delta Offset.zero.
    IE->>Preview: publish kind selectedMove, selectedMoveDelta Offset.zero
    IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for selected move preview
  else down is not admitted for selected move
    IE-->>Tools: route to other move mode behavior or ignore
  end

  loop pointer move samples for same token
    User->>Surface: pointer move
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample move)
    Tools->>IE: normalized finite move sample
    IE->>IE: compute previewDelta from session start position
    Note over IE,Spatial: No per-delta hit-test. Preview uses selected ids and the session delta captured at pointer down.
    IE->>Preview: replace immutable snapshot with selectedMoveDelta
    IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision when selectedMoveDelta changes
    Preview->>Frame: request main-scene repaint only
    Frame->>Store: capture committed frame facts once
    Frame->>SelectionFacts: capture selected ids once
    Frame->>Preview: capture selectedMoveDelta once
    Frame->>PlanCache: lookup ordinary paint plan by structural, bounds, elementVisual, viewport, and device keys
    alt ordinary paint plan cache hit
      PlanCache-->>Frame: ordinary committed RenderElementRecord list
    else ordinary paint plan cache miss
      Frame->>Spatial: query ordinary viewport candidates
      Spatial-->>Frame: ordinary candidate handles
      Frame->>Store: resolve ordinary handles against captured revisions
      Store-->>Frame: ordinary committed row views
      Frame->>PlanCache: store ordinary committed records only
    end
    Frame->>Frame: filter movable selected ids from ordinary records for this frame
    Frame->>Spatial: query selected supplement shifted by -previewDelta
    Spatial-->>Frame: selected supplement candidate handles
    Frame->>Store: resolve selected supplement handles against captured revisions
    Store-->>Frame: selected row views
    Frame->>Frame: build per-frame supplement records with previewDelta
    Frame->>Frame: merge filtered ordinary records and supplement by orderToken
    Note over Frame,PlanCache: Selected supplement records are per-frame and are not stored in PaintPlanCache.
    Frame->>Signals: publish main repaint request
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint main scene with selected move preview
  end

  User->>Surface: pointer up
  Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample up)
  Tools->>IE: same-token terminal sample
  IE->>IE: read proposedDelta from selected move session

  alt proposedDelta is zero or movable set is empty
    IE->>Preview: clear selected move preview and session
    IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
    Preview->>Frame: request main-scene repaint cleanup
    IE-->>Tools: finish with no edit and no action event
  else moved selection
    IE->>ReadPort: read selected move commit facts
    ReadPort->>SelectionFacts: read selected ids and selectionRevision
    SelectionFacts-->>ReadPort: selected ids
    ReadPort->>Store: read summary, moved element reads, and selected bounds
    Store-->>ReadPort: CanvasMoveCommitRequest inputs
    ReadPort-->>IE: CanvasMoveCommitRequest inputs

    opt resolver configured
      IE->>Resolver: resolve(request with proposedDelta)
      Resolver-->>IE: CanvasMoveCommit(delta) or CanvasMoveCancel
    end

    alt CanvasMoveCancel returned
      IE->>Preview: clear selected move preview and session
      IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
      Preview->>Frame: request main-scene repaint cleanup
      IE-->>Tools: finish with no edit and no action event
    else resolver throws or returns non-finite delta
      IE->>Preview: clear selected move preview and session
      IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
      Preview->>Frame: request main-scene repaint cleanup
      Note over EK,Store: No edit opens, no committed state changes, and no action event is published.
      IE-->>Tools: rethrow projected runtime-safe error
    else finite committed delta accepted
      IE->>EK: open synchronous interaction edit
      EK->>EK: reject disposed, nested edit, or resolver reentrant mutation
      EK->>Store: read committed revision snapshot
      Store-->>EK: committed tables and document revision
      EK->>SelectionFacts: read selection snapshot
      SelectionFacts-->>EK: selected ids and selectionRevision
      EK->>Draft: create rollback-safe draft
      IE->>EK: provide transform mutation request and moveSelection action descriptor
      EK->>Draft: for each movable selected id, set transform
      Note over EK,Draft: newTransform = CanvasTransform.translation(delta).multiply(oldTransform)
      Draft->>Touched: record transformedElementIds, geometryChangedElementIds, visualChangedElementIds
      EK->>Events: stage CanvasActionCommitted
      Note over Events: type moveSelection, elementIds in document order, payload CanvasTransformActionPayload(delta: CanvasTransform.translation(delta), operation: move, pivotWorld: null).
      EK->>EK: reject Future result before success path
      EK->>CC: compile exact touched set, revisions, invalidation, repaint intent
      Touched-->>CC: transformed ids and revision facts
      Note over CC: Projection revision and eviction are compiler effects, not TouchedSet fields.
      CC->>Store: preflight invariants
      Store-->>CC: preflight accepted
      CC->>Effects: prepare typed main RepaintIntent
      CC->>Events: attach staged moveSelection event to commit
      CC->>Applier: hand off compiled CommitPlan
      Applier->>Store: install compiled CommitPlan atomically
      Store->>Store: replace transform rows and revision state
      Note over Applier,Store: Atomic install is the commit boundary.
      Store-->>Applier: committed revision facts
      Applier->>Spatial: apply touched-id spatial update
      Applier->>Projection: evict public projection cache by projectionRevision
      Applier->>Events: commit buffered action and revision effects
      Applier->>Frame: publish committed main repaint bus
      EK->>EK: close edit session and stale handle
      EK-->>IE: edit result
      IE->>Preview: clear selected move preview and session
      IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
      Preview->>Frame: request main-scene repaint cleanup
      Events->>Signals: publish document and action notifications
      Frame->>Signals: publish committed and cleanup main repaint notifications
      Signals-->>Surface: repaint main scene without preview delta
      IE-->>Tools: terminal handling complete
    end
  end
